                                <p>题目6: 您认为此则评论“疑似AI"标签的准确程度是：</p>  
                                <div class="scale">  
                                    <input type="radio" id="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-1" name="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6" value="1" required>
                                    <label for="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-1">非常不准确</label>  
                                    <input type="radio" id="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-2" name="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6" value="2"> 
                                    <label for="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-2">不准确</label>
                                    <input type="radio" id="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-3" name="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6" value="3">  
                                    <label for="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-3">比较不准确</label> 
                                    <input type="radio" id="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-4" name="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6" value="4"> 
                                    <label for="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-4">不太确定</label>
                                    <input type="radio" id="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-5" name="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6" value="5">  
                                    <label for="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-5">比较准确</label>
                                    <input type="radio" id="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-6" name="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6" value="6"> 
                                    <label for="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-6">准确</label>
                                    <input type="radio" id="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-7" name="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6" value="7">  
                                    <label for="c<%= comment.cnum %>-q6-7">非常准确</label>
                                </div>  
                            </div>
                        <% } %>
                    </div>
                    
                <% }; %>  

                <div class="detection-trust">
                    <div class="question">
                        <p>您认为本平台AI生成内容检测工具的准确程度是：</p>
                        <div class="scale">  
                            <input type="radio" id="i<%= product.id %>-1" name="overview" value="1" required>
                            <label for="i<%= product.id %>-1">非常不准确</label>  
                            <input type="radio" id="i<%= product.id %>-2" name="overview" value="2">
                            <label for="i<%= product.id %>-2">不准确</label>
                            <input type="radio" id="i<%= product.id %>-3" name="overview" value="3">
                            <label for="i<%= product.id %>-3">比较不准确</label>
                            <input type="radio" id="i<%= product.id %>-4" name="overview" value="4">
                            <label for="i<%= product.id %>-4">不太确定</label>
                            <input type="radio" id="i<%= product.id %>-5" name="overview" value="5">
                            <label for="i<%= product.id %>-5">比较准确</label>
                            <input type="radio" id="i<%= product.id %>-6" name="overview" value="6">
